{"surface": "event", "title": "China blockades or attacks Taiwan by May 18, 2027", "html": "<div class=\"ev ws\"><div class=\"evh\"><h2 class=\"title\">China blockades or attacks Taiwan by May 18, 2027</h2><p class=\"facts\"><span>Any time to May 18, 2027</span><span class=\"sep\">·</span><span class=\"src\">Known from Major news reporting; government statements</span></p><div class=\"hds\"><details class=\"hd\" data-k=\"definition\"><summary>Definition</summary><div class=\"hdb text\"><p>By May 18, 2027 China&#x27;s military imposes a blockade or quarantine on Taiwan&#x27;s ports or airspace, or launches a military attack or invasion of territory Taiwan controls. Exercises around the island that end without stopping shipping do not count.</p></div></details><details class=\"hd\" data-k=\"notes\"><summary>Rationale</summary><div class=\"hdb\"><div class=\"note\" data-k=\"note:34\" data-note=\"note:34\"><div class=\"md\" data-md=\"An invasion by June 30, 2027 would nearly always have begun, or been preceded by a blockade, by May 18: May 18 is 180 of the 223 days to June 30, and a blockade phase comes first in most invasion scenarios.\"><p>An invasion by June 30, 2027 would nearly always have begun, or been preceded by a blockade, by May 18: May 18 is 180 of the 223 days to June 30, and a blockade phase comes first in most invasion scenarios.</p></div></div><div class=\"note\" data-k=\"note:35\" data-note=\"note:35\"><div class=\"md\" data-md=\"A blockade, quarantine or strike that stops short of invasion. Polymarket&#x27;s &#x27;China blockade Taiwan in 2026&#x27; trades near 2% for six weeks, which is mostly the floor such longshots trade at; Bloomberg Economics calls heightened tension without a full crisis &#x27;the most probable near-term path&#x27;. Xi pressed Taiwan with Trump on Nov 19 (&#x27;the United States must keep doing the right thing to avoid the emergence of great turbulence&#x27;), which is pressure through Washington, not a sign of imminent force. I put it at 1.5% over six months.\"><p>A blockade, quarantine or strike that stops short of invasion. Polymarket&#x27;s &#x27;China blockade Taiwan in 2026&#x27; trades near 2% for six weeks, which is mostly the floor such longshots trade at; Bloomberg Economics calls heightened tension without a full crisis &#x27;the most probable near-term path&#x27;. Xi pressed Taiwan with Trump on Nov 19 (&#x27;the United States must keep doing the right thing to avoid the emergence of great turbulence&#x27;), which is pressure through Washington, not a sign of imminent force. I put it at 1.5% over six months.</p></div></div><h4 class=\"ev-k\">Evidence</h4><div class=\"basis\"><p class=\"src\"><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"src:211\">taiwannews.com.tw</a></p><blockquote class=\"q\"><a class=\"go quote\" data-go=\"x:passage:src:211:2728b96c4168\">Even a blockade short of invasion would cut global GDP 5.3% and Taiwan’s 12.5%, Bloomberg projected, as chip inventories dwindle within weeks and production halts in dependent industries. Heightened tensions without a full crisis could trim global output 0.3% through modest tariffs and trade frictions, marking the most probable near-term path amid escalating gray-zone tactics from China.</a></blockquote></div></div></details></div></div><div class=\"strip\" data-count=\"5\" style=\"--cols:5\"><div class=\"sf first\" data-k=\"fig:Forecast\"><span class=\"lab\">Forecast</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:p:prop:4\"><span class=\"n v\">3.6%</span></a></span><a class=\"cap go calc\" data-go=\"x:p:prop:4\">How it’s set →</a></div><div class=\"sf\" data-k=\"fig:If Yes\"><span class=\"lab\">If Yes</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:outcome:prop:4:yes\"><span class=\"n v loss\">−$82,094</span></a></span><span class=\"cap\"><span class=\"n loss\">−16.32%</span> of portfolio</span></div><div class=\"sf\" data-k=\"fig:If No\"><span class=\"lab\">If No</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:outcome:prop:4:no\"><span class=\"n v gain\">+$3,055</span></a></span></div><div class=\"sf\" data-k=\"fig:Full impact\"><span class=\"lab\">Full impact</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:swing:prop:4\"><span class=\"n v loss\">−$85,149</span></a></span></div><div class=\"sf\" data-k=\"fig:Volatility\"><span class=\"lab\">Volatility</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:volatility:prop:4\"><span class=\"n v\">±$15,836</span></a></span></div></div><nav class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"outcomes\">Outcomes</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"probability\">Probability</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"assumptions\">Assumptions</button></nav><section data-pane=\"outcomes\"><div class=\"ev-card po-card\" data-k=\"payoff\"><div class=\"card-head\"><span class=\"plab\">P&amp;L by outcome</span><div class=\"rank po-switch\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"When\"><button type=\"button\" data-payoff=\"now\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Today</button><button type=\"button\" data-payoff=\"dated\">On May 18</button></div></div><div class=\"po-pane\" data-payoff-pane=\"now\"><div class=\"po-row\" data-outcome=\"yes\"><div class=\"po-lab\"><span class=\"po-title\">Yes</span><span class=\"po-p n\">3.6%</span></div><div class=\"po-track\"><i class=\"po-zero\" style=\"left:90.011%\"></i><i class=\"po-seg loss\" style=\"left:6.897%;right:calc(100% - 90.011%)\"></i></div><div class=\"po-val\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:outcome:prop:4:yes\"><span class=\"n v loss\">−$82,094</span></a></div></div><div class=\"po-row\" data-outcome=\"no\"><div class=\"po-lab\"><span class=\"po-title\">No</span><span class=\"otag\">Baseline</span><span class=\"po-p n\">96.4%</span></div><div class=\"po-track\"><i class=\"po-zero\" style=\"left:90.011%\"></i><i class=\"po-seg gain\" style=\"left:90.011%;right:calc(100% - 93.103%)\"></i></div><div class=\"po-val\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x